---
title: Placement rounds, one job, verified cleanup
---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: PodVigil job lifecycle
  accDescr: Validate each attempt before spending. Optional additional capacity rounds require a definite no-capacity answer and proof that no Pod was created and no volume remains. Between rounds, poll the catalog without creating storage or uploading inputs. Each real attempt keeps a separate ledger. Arm the watchdog, create owned storage and upload inputs, then create one Secure Cloud Pod and verify its identity. Its runtime starts at its own Pod request. Finalize and stop compute before retrieving results. Delete storage only after verified complete backup; otherwise retain it and report billing uncertainty.

  subgraph PREPARE["PREPARE"]
    direction TB
    PLAN["Validate job, limits and live placement"] --> PREP["New attempt ledger and watchdog<br/>Create volume and upload inputs"]
    PREP --> CREATE["Create one Pod<br/>Reconcile an ambiguous response"]
    CREATE --> VERIFY["Verify ownership, image, price and inputs"]
  end

  subgraph CAPACITY["OPTIONAL CAPACITY ROUNDS"]
    direction TB
    EMPTY{"No Pod created<br/>and no volume remains?"}
    EMPTY -->|"yes"| AGAIN{"Waiting enabled<br/>and allowance remains?"}
    EMPTY -->|"not proven"| STOP["End command<br/>Report outcome and resources"]
    AGAIN -->|"no"| STOP
    AGAIN -->|"yes"| POLL["Pause; catalog reads only<br/>Recheck price and budget"]
    POLL -->|"no capacity"| AGAIN
  end

  subgraph EXECUTE["RUN AND STOP COMPUTE"]
    direction TB
    RUN["Release workload<br/>Deadline fixed at this Pod request"]
    RUN --> END["Success, failure, cancellation<br/>or runtime deadline"]
    END --> SNAP["Stop writers and snapshot outputs<br/>Bounded finalization"]
    SNAP --> DELETE["Attempt Pod termination<br/>Even if finalization fails"]
    DELETE --> ABSENT{"Compute absence<br/>verified?"}
    ABSENT -->|"unknown"| UNKNOWN["Continue cleanup or report uncertainty<br/>Do not claim billing ended"]
  end

  subgraph RECOVERY["RECOVER AND CLOSE"]
    direction TB
    RECOVER["Retrieve and verify backup<br/>Audit every volume object"]
    RECOVER --> COMPLETE{"Complete and<br/>consistent?"}
    COMPLETE -->|"yes"| STORAGE["Delete owned volume<br/>Verify its absence"]
    COMPLETE -->|"no"| KEEP["Retain storage and recovery records<br/>Storage may still bill"]
    STORAGE --> DONE["Report workload outcome<br/>and both resource states"]
  end

  PREPARE --> EXECUTE
  PREPARE -->|"whole round: definite no capacity"| CAPACITY
  CAPACITY -->|"candidate reports capacity"| PREPARE
  EXECUTE -->|"only after compute absence is verified"| RECOVERY

  classDef primary fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#3864a2,color:#142b49,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef store fill:#e7f5ef,stroke:#35745d,color:#163c2f,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef caution fill:#fff5dc,stroke:#b58a25,color:#483a18,stroke-width:2px;

  class PLAN,PREP,CREATE,VERIFY,POLL,RUN,END,SNAP,DELETE,RECOVER,STORAGE primary;
  class DONE store;
  class UNKNOWN,KEEP,STOP caution;
